        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Industrial residue wood, GLT production, indoor use, u=10%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, GLT production, indoor use, u=10%, at plant
The multi-output process "glued laminated timber, indoor use, production" delivers the two coproducts "glued laminated timber, indoor use, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, GLT production, indoor use, u=10%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: 2531c17b-0c74-3fad-8c28-e758ec06f2aa
Includes the inputs to the production processes, transports of those inputs and the process emissions as far as they are available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Estimate based on data for three layered laminated board
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for the product and the region is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2531c17b-0c74-3fad-8c28-e758ec06f2aa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
